msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: zh_CN\n"

msgid "Factions that live on their own: a new faction with its own name appears in the Hub, earns money, recruits and grows in tech. When all its members are dead it is gone."
msgstr "自主运作的派系：一个拥有独特名称的新派系会出现在中心城，赚钱、招募成员并提升科技。当其所有成员死亡时，它便会消失。"

msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "The whole mod."
msgstr "整个模组。"

msgid "Easy - skills 10"
msgstr "简单 - 技能 10"

msgid "Medium - skills 30"
msgstr "中等 - 技能 30"

msgid "Hard - skills 50"
msgstr "困难 - 技能 50"

msgid "Very hard - skills 70"
msgstr "非常困难 - 技能 70"

msgid "Difficulty"
msgstr "难度"

msgid "Skills of the founders of a new faction: every skill starts at this level. Applies to factions founded after the change."
msgstr "新派系创始成员的技能：所有技能从该等级开始。对更改后成立的派系生效。"

msgid "Start money"
msgstr "初始资金"

msgid "Money of a new faction when it is founded. Recruits in the Hub ask 3000-6000; until stage 2 the faction only earns 15 per member an hour. Applies to factions founded after the change."
msgstr "新派系成立时的资金。中心城的新兵要价 3000-6000；在第 2 阶段之前，派系每名成员每小时只赚 15。对更改后成立的派系生效。"

msgid "Faction window key"
msgstr "派系窗口按键"

msgid "Opens and closes the window with the state of the factions. Click and press a key; Backspace - no key."
msgstr "打开或关闭显示派系状态的窗口。点击后按下按键；Backspace - 不设按键。"

msgid "Diagnostics"
msgstr "诊断"

msgid "Detailed log"
msgstr "详细日志"

msgid "Details in RE_Kenshi_log.txt: every hourly tick of a faction, saving and loading."
msgstr "在 RE_Kenshi_log.txt 中记录详情：派系每小时的行动、存档与读档。"

msgid "Day %d, %02d:00"
msgstr "第 %d 天 %02d:00"

msgid "Founded in the Hub"
msgstr "在中心城成立"

msgid "Hired a recruit in town"
msgstr "在城里雇佣了一人"

msgid "All members are dead - the faction is extinct"
msgstr "所有成员已死亡 - 派系已覆灭"

msgid "Reached tech level %d"
msgstr "科技达到 %d 级"

msgid "human"
msgstr "人类"

msgid "shek"
msgstr "沙克"

msgid "skeleton"
msgstr "骷髅"

msgid "hive"
msgstr "蜂巢"

msgid "Race:"
msgstr "种族："

msgid "Not founded yet - waits until the Hub is loaded"
msgstr "尚未成立 - 等待中心城加载"

msgid "Founded:"
msgstr "成立于："

msgid "Members: %d of %d"
msgstr "成员：%d / %d"

msgid "Money: %d"
msgstr "资金：%d"

msgid "Cheapest recruit in town: %d (needs %d)"
msgstr "城中最便宜的新兵：%d（需要 %d）"

msgid "Hiring:"
msgstr "招募："

msgid "Tech: level %d (maximum)"
msgstr "科技：%d 级（上限）"

msgid "Tech: level %d, %d of %d points"
msgstr "科技：%d 级，%d / %d 点"

msgid "Status:"
msgstr "状态："

msgid "extinct"
msgstr "已覆灭"

msgid "active"
msgstr "活跃"

msgid "waiting"
msgstr "等待中"

msgid "Recent events:"
msgstr "最近事件："

msgid "Dynamic Factions"
msgstr "动态派系"

msgid "Waiting for the game..."
msgstr "等待游戏..."

msgid "No dynamic factions in this game yet."
msgstr "本局游戏中还没有动态派系。"

msgid "Looking for work? %s could use another pair of hands."
msgstr "在找活干吗？%s 正缺人手。"

msgid "Depends. What does it pay?"
msgstr "那得看给多少钱。"

msgid "Food, a roof and a share of the loot."
msgstr "管饭、有住处，还能分战利品。"

msgid "%d cats now, food and a roof later."
msgstr "现在给 %d 卡特，之后管饭管住。"

msgid "Deal. Lead the way."
msgstr "成交。带路吧。"

msgid "going to a recruit (%d)"
msgstr "正前往新兵处（%d）"

msgid "talking to a recruit (%d)"
msgstr "正在与新兵交谈（%d）"

msgid "A faction founded in the Hub mines, carries and sells real ore, then hires ordinary recruits from its actual budget. No passive income or purchased tech points."
msgstr "在枢纽镇建立的派系开采、运输并出售真实矿石，再用实际预算招募普通成员。没有被动收入或购买科技点数。"

msgid "Money of a new faction when it is founded. Further income comes only from real sales. Applies to factions founded after the change."
msgstr "新派系建立时的资金。后续收入仅来自真实交易。更改只适用于此后建立的派系。"

msgid "Mining and trade"
msgstr "采矿与贸易"

msgid "Mine real resources, carry ore and sell it to town traders. No passive income or virtual ore."
msgstr "开采真实资源，搬运矿石并出售给城镇商人。没有被动收入或虚拟矿石。"

msgid "Resource search radius"
msgstr "资源搜索半径"

msgid "Search and scout within this distance from the Hub. Only resources observed by faction members become known."
msgstr "在距枢纽镇此范围内搜索与侦察。只有派系成员发现的资源才会被记录。"

msgid "Work paused: a transfer needs reconciliation."
msgstr "工作已暂停：物品转移需要核对。"

msgid "I have ore to sell."
msgstr "我有矿石要卖。"

msgid "Mining: %d; hauling: %d; cargo: %d; sales this session: %d"
msgstr "采矿：%d；搬运：%d；货物：%d；本次收入：%d"

msgid "Sold %d units of ore for %d cats"
msgstr "已出售 %d 单位矿石，收入 %d 开币"

msgid "Research is paused until real research work is implemented."
msgstr "研究已暂停，等待实现实际研究工作。"

msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

msgid "Bought food for %d cats"
msgstr "购买食物花费 %d 开币"

msgid "Food supply: %s; spent this session: %d"
msgstr "食物补给：%s；本次游戏花费：%d"

msgid "A faction in the Hub mines and sells real ore, buys and eats food, and hires ordinary recruits from its actual budget. No passive income."
msgstr "中心城的派系开采并出售真实矿石，购买和食用食物，并用自己的资金雇用普通新兵。没有被动收入。"

msgid "Mine real resources, carry ore and sell it to town traders. Food supply continues when work is disabled."
msgstr "开采真实资源、搬运矿石并卖给城镇商人。关闭工作后，食物补给仍会继续。"

msgid "Details of supply, confirmed purchases, work, saving and loading in RE_Kenshi_log.txt. Errors are always logged."
msgstr "在 RE_Kenshi_log.txt 中记录补给、已确认购买、工作、保存和读取的详细信息。错误始终记录。"
